+# Invoice review service
+
+## Purpose
+
+This project reviews invoice line items for duplicate references and arithmetic mismatches. It returns findings to a human finance operator.
+
+## Boundaries
+
+- The service supports human review; it never authorizes or sends a payment.
+- The current TypeScript source implements detection of duplicate invoice references.
+- Arithmetic-mismatch review is part of the README-stated project purpose, but its implementation is not evidenced by the current source.
